The R code snippet below uses the irw package to fetch all of the tables that match the filters specified here. Note: a difference between the functionality of the filters here and the behavior of irw_filter() is that specifying values for a given argument of irw_filter() will result in NA values being dropped, while they can be included here. The “Has item text?” filter is also not reflected in the snippet, since irw_filter() does not support filtering by item-text availability; use irw_list_itemtext_tables() separately for that.







































































































































